  "content": {
    "baseCase": [
      "Boy, 10 years old; girl, 10 years old; both children, from the same Scout group.",
      "During an activity, the boy asks to see and touch the girl’s private parts.",
      "He tells her “not to tell anyone”.",
      "The girl tells her mother; the mother goes to the group and expects action.",
      "The boy has diagnosed psychological disorders (including ADHD)."
    ],
    "caseSupport": [
      {
        "items": [
          "Request to see/touch private parts + instruction to keep it secret = risk markers.",
          "Sign of possible abuse or attempted sexual abuse between peers.",
          "Being the same age does not mean “natural curiosity”: asking for secrecy shows awareness that it is wrong.",
          "The boy’s disorders do not remove the need for protection and reporting.",
          "Both are children (ECA, art. 2): the State’s response goes through the Conselho Tutelar, with protective measures only (art. 105)."
        ],
        "title": "What does this behavior indicate?"
      },
      {
        "items": [
          "Protect the girl within the group’s activities.",
          "Record what happened in an objective and confidential way.",
          "Report to the Conselho Tutelar and to the Escoteiros do Brasil Conduct Channel; guide the family (police, etc.).",
          "Adopt internal safety measures (preventive removal, supervision).",
          "Work with the families separately and in a protected way."
        ],
        "title": "Duties of the Scout group"
      }
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Treating it as “child’s play”.",
      "Resolving it only “between families”, without involving the authorities.",
      "Exposing the girl (having her repeat the account several times or in front of many people).",
      "Questioning the girl or asking for details: listening belongs to the protection network.",
      "Letting the boy take part normally, without restrictions.",
      "Taking on the role of investigator or judge."
    ],
    "flow": [
      {
        "items": [
          "Separate the two, without creating another risk.",
          "Each stays with an adult, in view of others. No one is left isolated, neither the girl nor the boy.",
          "The separation is discreet and given no explanation to the other young people."
        ],
        "title": "Immediate protection of the girl"
