      {
        "items": [
          "Conselho Tutelar, Police Station, Dial 100, 190 (if there is immediate risk).",
          "The duty to report belongs to the group (Law 13.431/2017, art. 13; POR, Rule 143, V).",
          "Report to the Escoteiros do Brasil Conduct Channel (Integrity Directorate) and notify the Region.",
          "The group cannot treat it as a “matter only between families”."
        ],
        "title": "Report to the authorities and to Escoteiros do Brasil"
      },
      {
        "items": [
