              "Maintains the bond: stays in contact with the family and does not treat the boy as a closed case.",
              "Refers him to the network: the Conselho Tutelar can require psychological treatment (ECA, art. 101, V) and oblige the parents to send him to specialized treatment (art. 129, VI).",
