        "staysSame": [
          "The group does not take on the role of judge; it does not decide who is telling the truth.",
          "Removes the boy preventively, even with the denial. The measure protects, does not depend on a confession and does not declare guilt. It is temporary and is reviewed when the protection network responds.",
